  m_text: "Your ship is lost \u2014 scattered somewhere across the void. You're stranded
    on a fragile space raft, drifting between stars \u2014 but not helpless.\r\nSpawn
    and collect loot using your magnet to build new blocks onto your raft. Use this
    growing platform to survive the drift and reach the next planet.\r\nThere, you\u2019ll
    find your next critical item \u2014 a tool that might bring you one step closer
    to reclaiming your ship."
